    "notes": "R8 taper coefficients from TOTAL array (r, c, e, p, a, b \u2014 forest-invariant) plus forest-group-specific A4/B4 (DIB at 4.5 ft) and A17/B17 (DIB at 17.3 ft) from R8CF table in volume/NVEL/r8dib.f. Lookup mirrors R8PREPCOEF (volume/NVEL/r8clkdib.f:34-97): pre-lookup species-alias remap (r8clkdib.f:34-51) then binary search by R8CF(,1)*1000 + R8CF(,2) = group*1000 + species; on miss, retry with group=9 (universal fallback, r8clkdib.f:82-97). Default forest group = '4' matches native FVSsn FORKOD default (Alabama Bankhead, sn/forkod.f:526-534 \u2192 voleqdef.f:1896-1899). Legacy scalar a4/b4/a17/b17 fields under species_coefficients retained only as last-resort fallback. CLKCOEF stores B then A, so 'a' column = B (taper), 'b' column = A (inflection). Values are stored here in correct a=inflection, b=taper convention."
